### =========================================================================
### PHASE E: SLA DEADLINE & ESALATION TEST FLOW (via Gateway :8080)
### =========================================================================

### 1. Publish SLA-Enabled Blueprint in template-service
POST http://localhost:8080/templates/api/v1/templates
Authorization: Bearer architect_01:ROLE_WORKFLOW_ARCHITECT
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateKey": "VENDOR_ONBOARDING_SLA",
  "name": "Vendor Onboarding with Step SLAs",
  "description": "Blueprint featuring 24h KYC SLA and 48h Legal Counsel SLA",
  "initialState": "AWAITING_KYC_DOCS",
  "steps": {
    "AWAITING_KYC_DOCS": {
      "stepOrder": 1,
      "stepName": "Submit KYC Documents",
      "stepType": "DOCUMENT_SUBMISSION",
      "actorScope": "REQUESTER",
      "requiredRole": null,
      "slaHours": 24,
      "requiredPayloadKeys": ["panCardUrl", "gstCertUrl"],
      "isTerminal": false,
      "transitions": {
        "SUBMIT_DOCS": "PENDING_LEGAL_VERIFY"
      }
    },
    "PENDING_LEGAL_VERIFY": {
      "stepOrder": 2,
      "stepName": "Legal Counsel Verification",
      "stepType": "APPROVAL",
      "actorScope": "ROLE",
      "requiredRole": "ROLE_LEGAL_COUNSEL",
      "slaHours": 48,
      "requiredPayloadKeys": [],
      "isTerminal": false,
      "transitions": {
        "VERIFY_AND_ONBOARD": "ONBOARDED",
        "REJECT": "REJECTED"
      }
    },
    "ONBOARDED": {
      "stepOrder": 3,
      "stepName": "Vendor Fully Onboarded",
      "stepType": "TERMINAL",
      "actorScope": "ANY",
      "requiredRole": null,
      "slaHours": null,
      "requiredPayloadKeys": [],
      "isTerminal": true,
      "transitions": {}
    },
    "REJECTED": {
      "stepOrder": 4,
      "stepName": "Application Rejected",
      "stepType": "TERMINAL",
      "actorScope": "ANY",
      "requiredRole": null,
      "slaHours": null,
      "requiredPayloadKeys": [],
      "isTerminal": true,
      "transitions": {}
    }
  }
}

### 2. Publish the SLA Blueprint
PUT http://localhost:8080/templates/api/v1/templates/VENDOR_ONBOARDING_SLA/versions/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer architect_01:ROLE_WORKFLOW_ARCHITECT

### 3. Create Workflow Instance (Expects: currentStepDueAt ~= now + 24h, slaBreached: false)
POST http://localhost:8080/workflows/api/v1/workflows
Authorization: Bearer usr_ashish_01:ROLE_EMPLOYEE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "VENDOR_ONBOARDING_SLA",
  "title": "Acme Corp SLA Test"
}

### 4. Check Requester Task Inbox (Expects: currentStepDueAt populated, slaBreached: false)
GET http://localhost:8080/workflows/api/v1/tasks/inbox
Authorization: Bearer usr_ashish_01:ROLE_EMPLOYEE

### 5. Transition Workflow - Submit Documents (Expects: moves to PENDING_LEGAL_VERIFY, currentStepDueAt ~= now + 48h)
POST http://localhost:8080/workflows/api/v1/workflows/<WORKFLOW_ID>/transition
Authorization: Bearer usr_ashish_01:ROLE_EMPLOYEE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SUBMIT_DOCS",
  "comments": "Submitting valid PAN and GST certificates",
  "payload": {
    "panCardUrl": "https://storage.internal/kyc/pan.pdf",
    "gstCertUrl": "https://storage.internal/kyc/gst.pdf"
  }
}

### 6. Segregation of Duties Negative Test (Requester cannot approve Legal step -> 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/workflows/api/v1/workflows/<WORKFLOW_ID>/transition
Authorization: Bearer usr_ashish_01:ROLE_LEGAL_COUNSEL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "VERIFY_AND_ONBOARD",
  "comments": "Attempting self-approval"
}

### 7. Legal Counsel Approval (Advances to ONBOARDED -> currentStepDueAt becomes null)
POST http://localhost:8080/workflows/api/v1/workflows/<WORKFLOW_ID>/transition
Authorization: Bearer legal_counsel_meera:ROLE_LEGAL_COUNSEL,ROLE_EMPLOYEE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "VERIFY_AND_ONBOARD",
  "comments": "KYC verified. Compliant."
}

### 8. Fetch CQRS Projection in audit-analytics-service
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/api/v1/analytics/workflows/<WORKFLOW_ID>
Authorization: Bearer auditor_01:ROLE_AUDITOR
